{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survivors Of The Zombie World is a 3D pixel-style zombie survival game. Survivors fight in a world full of zombies, looking for food, ammunition, medicine and other supplies on the map and trying to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Current Features\u25c6 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985910/extras/EN_2.gif?t=1750513967\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----3D pixel survival shooting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985910/extras/EN_1.gif?t=1750513967\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----Story mode: Contains 40+ levels, you can clear the zombies to pass the level, you need to escape to the destination, you need to collect some items. Various small easter eggs are waiting for you to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985910/extras/EN_3.gif?t=1750513967\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----Survival mode: You need to survive in various terrains. Time is long, and you need to find something to eat when you are hungry. If you run out of ammunition, you need to find supplies. It is too dark at night, you have to turn on the flashlight, or hide in a safe corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985910/extras/EN_4.gif?t=1750513967\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----Defense mode: A large wave of zombies rush into the base, and you must pick up weapons to protect the last piece of land. There are electric towers around the door, which can protect you, but you must pay attention to maintenance and pick up supplies in time. Zombies are getting stronger and stronger, I wish you good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985910/extras/EN_5.gif?t=1750513967\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----Temporarily supports LAN online mode, and survive with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----More than 20 survivors can be chosen, and they have their own characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985910/extras/EN_7.gif?t=1750513967\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2985910?t=1750513967","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985910/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750513967","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985910/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750513967","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985910/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750513967","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>About us</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We will continue to update the game and improve the gaming experience. Thank you for your support and patience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wish you all a happy game\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014\u2014 \u201cSurvivors Of The Zombie World\u201d Developer: Kt&amp;Tata</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survivors Of The Zombie World is a 3D pixel-style zombie survival game. Survivo